    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049010/extras/103b798be17e6325142b9d43cd0f5efc.poster.avif?t=1741634773\" width=800 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049010/extras/103b798be17e6325142b9d43cd0f5efc.webm?t=1741634773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049010/extras/103b798be17e6325142b9d43cd0f5efc.mp4?t=1741634773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each randomly generated level, you must reach the exit. But beware of monsters, traps and curses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the fifth level, a boss fight awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build item combos !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049010/extras/24b71f9e5033d4a4facf73b558e7c7d4.poster.avif?t=1741634773\" width=424 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049010/extras/24b71f9e5033d4a4facf73b558e7c7d4.webm?t=1741634773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049010/extras/24b71f9e5033d4a4facf73b558e7c7d4.mp4?t=1741634773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 80 items to unlock. Find as much item as you can during a run, with treasure rooms, shop and casinos and build devastating combos !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select Curses</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049010/extras/7b753d53fe0229fbf60223efd58c384d.poster.avif?t=1741634773\" width=520 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049010/extras/7b753d53fe0229fbf60223efd58c384d.webm?t=1741634773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049010/extras/7b753d53fe0229fbf60223efd58c384d.mp4?t=1741634773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress further into the dungeon. Every level finished you must select a curse that will be applied for all next levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each curse affect the experience in a level in a meaningful way, like adding toxic puddles everywhere, mines in the walls,<br>spawning bombs on enemie's death, and much more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will you be able to reach the bottom of the Dungeon ?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049010/extras/103b798be17e6325142b9d43cd0f5efc.poster.avif?t=1741634773\" width=800 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049010/extras/103b798be17e6325142b9d43cd0f5efc.webm?t=1741634773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049010/extras/103b798be17e6325142b9d43cd0f5efc.mp4?t=1741634773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each randomly generated level, you must reach the exit. But beware of monsters, traps and curses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the fifth level, a boss fight awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build item combos !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049010/extras/24b71f9e5033d4a4facf73b558e7c7d4.poster.avif?t=1741634773\" width=424 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049010/extras/24b71f9e5033d4a4facf73b558e7c7d4.webm?t=1741634773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049010/extras/24b71f9e5033d4a4facf73b558e7c7d4.mp4?t=1741634773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 80 items to unlock. Find as much item as you can during a run, with treasure rooms, shop and casinos and build devastating combos !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select Curses</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049010/extras/7b753d53fe0229fbf60223efd58c384d.poster.avif?t=1741634773\" width=520 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049010/extras/7b753d53fe0229fbf60223efd58c384d.webm?t=1741634773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049010/extras/7b753d53fe0229fbf60223efd58c384d.mp4?t=1741634773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress further into the dungeon. Every level finished you must select a curse that will be applied for all next levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each curse affect the experience in a level in a meaningful way, like adding toxic puddles everywhere, mines in the walls,<br>spawning bombs on enemie's death, and much more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will you be able to reach the bottom of the Dungeon ?</p>",
    "short_description": "Descend into the unknown in this unique roguelike platformer! Brave a constantly shifting dungeon filled with deadly monsters, traps, and powerful relics. The deeper you go, the greater the challenge. Uncover secrets, explore diverse environments, and fight to discover what awaits at the bottom.",
